  "observations": [
    "Role-dispatch, scanner UI and execution UI exceed their original 45-second file bounds. Partial TAP without final counts is not accepted.",
    "Authority UI preserves native task checks but its original visible-path assertion fails: JSON scope serialization escapes Windows separators, so the literal repository path is absent. This is a presentation defect, not evidence of a missing native check.",
    "One native installation scenario times out at the existing shortcut writer deadline after utility-loaded. The exact stage and child cleanup are retained; cause remains under investigation."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Only the failed client lane and four failed complete-source workers are audited here. This is not a full cohort acceptance.",
    "The later atomic startup/shutdown fix has separate source and installed evidence; native follow-up remains pending.",
    "All five small ZIPs were hashed in memory; only JSON receipts are retained. No helper/runtime download, manual CI retry, deadline change, new skip or weakened assertion occurred."
